{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はぁ……蒸すなぁ……","trans":"呼……好闷啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"暑くないか、霧子","trans":"不热吗，雾子","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"こういう時の方がかえって\r\n熱中症が心配なんだ","trans":"这种时候反而\n更担心中暑","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ちょっと木陰入ろうか","trans":"去树荫下待一会儿吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010020","name":"霧子","text":"はい……","trans":"好的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010030","name":"霧子","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"プロデューサー","text":"霧子……！？","trans":"雾子……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"大丈夫か！？\r\nケガは…………","trans":"没事吧！？\n有没有受伤…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010040","name":"霧子","text":"だ、大丈夫です……\r\nあの……","trans":"没、没事……\n那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010050","name":"霧子","text":"柔らかい……","trans":"好软……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ────\r\nはは、うん","trans":"啊————\n哈哈，嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-23","name":"プロデューサー","text":"綺麗な芝だ","trans":"很漂亮的草坪","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010070","name":"霧子","text":"ふわ……ふわ……","trans":"蓬……蓬……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-27","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははは、起き上がらないのか？\r\nどれ……","trans":"哈哈哈，不起来吗？\n那我也……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-29","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お……本当だ\r\nふわふわしてるな","trans":"哦……真的\n软软的呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-30","name":"プロデューサー","text":"それに……ひんやりしてる","trans":"而且……凉凉的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-35","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……少し、座っていくか","trans":"……坐一会儿吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-36","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いい具合の陰だし","trans":"阴凉也正好","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-38","name":"プロデューサー","text":"もう少し、風でも出てきてくれればいいんだけどなぁ……！","trans":"要是能再起一点风就好了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-45","name":"母親","text":"こらー\r\n走らないー","trans":"喂——\n别跑——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010111","name":"霧子＆プロデューサー","text":"うわっ……","trans":"哇……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-52","name":"プロデューサー","text":"大丈夫かい、君……","trans":"你没事吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-54","name":"母親","text":"すみません、びっくりさせてー","trans":"不好意思，吓到你了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-55","name":"母親","text":"────ほら、行くよー","trans":"————来，走了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010140","name":"霧子","text":"風も……","trans":"风也……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010150","name":"霧子","text":"追いかけてきたみたい……","trans":"好像追过来了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-73","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ほんとだ","trans":"真的呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-77","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……気持ちいいなぁ","trans":"……真舒服啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010190","name":"霧子","text":"ちょっとだけ……","trans":"只有一点点……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010200","name":"霧子","text":"風が……\r\n来てくれたみたい……","trans":"风……\n好像来了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-93","name":"プロデューサー","text":"風みたいに走っていっちゃったな？","trans":"跑得像风一样呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-98","name":"プロデューサー","text":"すぐ走っていってしまったけど……","trans":"一下子就跑走了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-100","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あ、霧子も痛くなかったんだもんな\r\nじゃあ大丈夫かな","trans":"啊，雾子也没觉得疼吧\n那就应该没事","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010240","name":"霧子","text":"ふわ……\r\nふわ……","trans":"蓬……\n蓬……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010250","name":"霧子","text":"ひんやり……","trans":"凉凉的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010260","name":"霧子","text":"わかったのかも……","trans":"也许是懂了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010270","name":"霧子","text":"ここの……\r\n芝の……みんなが……","trans":"这里……\n草坪的……大家……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2008015010280","name":"霧子","text":"受け止めてくれたこと……","trans":"接住了我……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-115","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、うん\r\nそうだといいな","trans":"哈哈，嗯\n那样就好了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}